  "notes": "Pure black dark-mode UI with a dim illustrated night-desk scene (desk lamp, potted plant, keyboard, coffee mug, window to a city at night) faintly visible behind the main area's edges — gives a cozy, after-hours personality. Tool rows use a 24px line icon, bold name, tiny grey '·'-separated provenance meta, a circular check icon with tooltip, description in grey and a status line ('Installed' / 'Not installed' + 'Add'). Pill (999px/16px radius) buttons with subtle 1px outlines; active settings nav item uses a #2a2a2a filled rectangle. The only color is a blue 'New' update link in the sidebar header. Sidebar recents mix colored folder icons (orange, green, blue, purple) for projects with pinned pushpins and right-aligned relative times. The list pane scrolls internally; the capture shows only the first ~5 rows at 900px."
